      <div class="container">
        <p class="page-definition">Soleur is a source-available platform that turns a solo founder into a full company: {{ stats.agents }} AI agents and {{ stats.skills }} workflow skills across {{ stats.departments }} departments, all sharing one knowledge base. You delegate work in plain language; the agents execute and remember every decision.</p>
        <div class="page-citations">
          <p>Built on open standards:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Source-available under the <a href="{{ site.github }}/blob/main/LICENSE" rel="noopener noreferrer">Business Source License 1.1</a> &mdash; free to use, modify, and self-host; converts to Apache-2.0 four years after each release.</li>
            <li>Runs on agentic coding harnesses &mdash; self-hosted today on <a href="https://docs.claude.com/en/docs/claude-code" rel="noopener noreferrer">Claude Code</a>, Grok Build, Codex, Devin CLI, and OpenCode, each with its own setup guide below.</li>
